    <paragraph>Each of hydra-zen’s <reference internal="1" refuri="../api_reference#create-config"><inline classes="std std-ref">config-creation functions</inline></reference> has a <literal classes="xref py py-obj">zen_config</literal>
        parameter, which can be passed a dictionary to modify the function’s value and type conversion behaviors. <literal classes="xref py py-obj">hydra_zen.typing.ZenConfig</literal> is a <reference internal="0" reftitle="(in Python v3.15)" refuri="https://docs.python.org/3/library/typing.html#typing.TypedDict"><literal classes="xref py py-class">typing.TypedDict</literal></reference>
        that can be used as a convenience function to view and override these options.</paragraph>
    <paragraph>The following documentation details the available zen-convert options and shows
        example use cases.</paragraph>
    <target refid="zen-convert"></target>
    <section ids="hydra-zen-typing-zenconvert zen-convert" names="hydra_zen.typing.zenconvert zen-convert">
        <title>hydra_zen.typing.ZenConvert</title>
